WEBVTT

00:16:58.524 --> 00:17:01.167
Accenture development partnerships
moved him to Colombia

00:17:01.191 --> 00:17:03.554
where he joined
the project team full time.

00:17:03.578 --> 00:17:05.125
GA: It was a dream come true.

00:17:05.149 --> 00:17:06.330
I called my mom.

00:17:06.354 --> 00:17:08.942
We laughed, we smiled, we danced.

00:17:10.242 --> 00:17:12.990
AG: This isn't the only way
Gonzalo gives back.

00:17:13.014 --> 00:17:15.084
Every year he's gone back
to the conference

00:17:15.108 --> 00:17:18.385
where he was first inspired
by someone he felt he could relate to.

00:17:18.409 --> 00:17:20.679
GA: It feels like I'm doing my mission.

00:17:20.703 --> 00:17:22.068
I was in their shoes one day

00:17:22.092 --> 00:17:24.394
and now I'm the person lifting up,

00:17:24.418 --> 00:17:26.140
just as others lift me up.

00:17:26.164 --> 00:17:28.211
And there's people
lifting me up right now.

00:17:28.235 --> 00:17:30.869
There's going to be a brighter
future for my community.